# Workbench live Output filename → download

Evidence: BUG-2026-08-07 / #904 / S051 — preview updated, Download stayed on convert-time name.

1. **One live resolver** — For manual-input results, single Download and ZIP
   member names must use the current sanitized Output filename (same source as
   the field preview), not a convert-time-only baked `originalName`.
2. **Tag manual slots** — Keep `liveOutputSlot` (or successor shared API) so
   download code can recompute names after rename.
3. **Uploads unchanged** — File-queue / upload results keep their own names;
   do not force live Output filename onto uploads unless product says so.
4. **Regression** — Keep
   `apps/frontend/src/test/bug-2026-08-07-output-filename-download-stale.test.tsx`
   and `tests/bugs/test_bug_2026_08_07_output_filename_download_stale.py` green
   when changing download naming.
